Subject: [PATCH 1321/3799] soh: rename func_8098394C ->
 DemoIk_Type1SetupAppear

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the type 1 cue-2 handler: ends any movement, snaps to the cue's start position, restores the shadow and switches to action mode 1 with the animation rewound.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c
